+/**
+ * AUTONOMOUS WORK PACKAGE 9: MONEY FACTORY ADVERSARIAL TEST SUITE
+ * 
+ * Attacks the Money Factory control plane across 19 adversarial scenarios:
+ * 1. Fake revenue
+ * 2. Synthetic revenue
